rem known-missing-css.bbj: harness control. Links a stylesheet that does not exist; the harness must classify it as fail with an HTTP 404.
web! = BBjAPI().getWebManager()
web!.injectLinkUrl("/courses-fixture-does-not-exist.css", 1, "rel=stylesheet")
wnd! = BBjAPI().openSysGui("X0").addWindow("Courses fixture missing css", $01101083$)
st! = wnd!.addStaticText("Missing CSS")
wnd!.setCallback(BBjAPI.ON_CLOSE, "byebye")
process_events

byebye:
release
